<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE -Final 1996 GDP on 5 March.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE -Final 1996 GDP on 5 March.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Federal Statistics Office said on Thursday it would release final data on 1996 gross domestic product on March 5.</p>
<p>The statistics office released the following preliminary GDP data on January 9:</p>
<p>    PAN-GERMAN GDP		    1996	 1995</p>
<p>    GDP change			  +1.4	 +1.9</p>
<p>    Private consumption	     +1.4	 +1.8</p>
<p>    Public consumption		+2.8	 +2.0</p>
<p>    Capital investment		+2.6	 +2.0</p>
<p>    Building investment	     -2.7	 +1.2</p>
<p>    Exports			     +4.6	 +5.9</p>
<p>    Imports			     +2.0	 +6.4</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
